---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy | Fresh Petals Hyderabad"
  description="Fresh Petals Hyderabad refund and replacement policy for fresh flowers, bouquets, pooja flowers, jasmine, garlands, flower boxes and custom orders."
>
  <main class="bg-white">
    <section class="px-5 py-12 md:px-8 md:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
          <p class="fp-eyebrow">
            Fresh Petals Hyderabad
          </p>

          <h1 class="fp-h1 mt-3">
            Refund Policy
          </h1>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D] md:text-base">
            Refund and replacement guidelines for fresh flower orders, market-price products, custom arrangements and delivery issues.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Fresh Flower Nature
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Fresh flowers are perishable and depend on daily market availability, weather, handling and delivery timing. Because of this, refunds and replacements are handled case by case after reviewing the order details and issue shared by the customer.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Order Confirmation
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Orders are confirmed only after WhatsApp confirmation of product availability, final price, delivery fee, delivery slot and payment details. If a flower is unavailable before confirmation, we may suggest alternatives or cancel the order before payment.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Refund Eligibility
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              <p>A refund or replacement may be considered in cases such as:</p>

              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li>• Wrong item delivered compared to confirmed order</li>
                <li>• Major damage during delivery</li>
                <li>• Order not delivered due to Fresh Petals operational issue</li>
                <li>• Payment received but order could not be fulfilled</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Non-Refundable Cases
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              <p>Refunds may not be applicable in the following cases:</p>

              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li>• Customer unavailable during delivery slot</li>
                <li>• Incorrect or incomplete delivery address</li>
                <li>• Change of mind after order preparation has started</li>
                <li>• Minor natural variation in flower shade, size or arrangement style</li>
                <li>• Delay caused by traffic, weather, apartment/security restrictions or customer-side coordination issues</li>
                <li>• Custom, bulk, garland, poola jada, event or market-price orders after sourcing/preparation has started</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Replacement Policy
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              If there is a genuine quality or delivery issue, Fresh Petals may offer a replacement, partial replacement, store credit or refund depending on the situation, product type and availability of flowers.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Reporting an Issue
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Any issue must be reported on WhatsApp as soon as possible after delivery, preferably with clear photos or videos of the product and packaging. Since flowers are perishable, delayed complaints may be difficult to verify.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Market-Price Products
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Pooja flowers, jasmine/malli, garlands, poola jada, loose flowers, temple flowers and bulk flowers often depend on daily wholesale market rates. Once the customer confirms the final price and sourcing begins, cancellation or refund may not be possible.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Cancellation Before Preparation
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              If cancellation is requested before sourcing or preparation begins, we may allow cancellation depending on order type and timing. For urgent, same-day, customized or bulk orders, cancellation may not be possible once work has started.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Refund Timeline
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              If a refund is approved, the refund method and timeline will be shared on WhatsApp. Refunds may be processed through UPI or the original payment method depending on how payment was collected.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-[24px] border border-[#E8D8DE] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
            Need help with an order?
          </h2>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
            Share your order details, issue and photos on WhatsApp for review.
          </p>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/919652012274?text=Hi%20Fresh%20Petals%2C%20I%20need%20help%20with%20an%20order%20issue."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#075838] px-7 py-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white transition hover:bg-[#7C243E]"
          >
            Contact on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>